for r in setup:
 review(\"04\",r,\"fail\",\"The landing page gives a decision-facing setup-time answer as a universal guarantee. The approved evidence only gives an observed median. The separate permission FAQ matches its policy and the status-code table is owner-attested.\")
finding(\"04\",\"setup-guarantee\",\"Setup-time guarantee exceeds the onboarding study\",setup,\"Remove the universal 10-minute guarantee. If reporting the study, state the 15-minute median across 20 observed sessions.\",\"Verify the exact sample size and statistic against lines 3–5 and check that the revised copy makes no guarantee or wider-population claim.\",\"high\")
